WEBVTT

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:05.960
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:10.090
wondering what I should do right now.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:16.550
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:21.100
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:26.730
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:32.150
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:36.610
So faraway - let's run!

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:42.910
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.210
Oh someday - one of these days

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:52.300
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:58.380
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:03.970
depend on me for your repairs.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:08.350
So faraway - let's run!

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:14.570
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.860
Oh someday - one of these days

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:24.910
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:39.590
One out of 36,000 Seconds

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.610
<i>That prison is the securest one they have in France.</i>

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.620
<i>Taking a shot from the outside is damn near impossible.</i>

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:10.120
<i>So I gathered all the relative information about that prison.</i>

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.330
<i>Also, the other day...</i>

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:18.380
<i>...I heard from a former prisoner that there's a chance one might be able to thread the needle.</i>

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.280
<i>Take a look at this.</i>

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:52.330
<i>There is a direct path from the man's cell to the revolving door leading to the plaza.</i>

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:09.520
<i>The only chance you get to see the cell is when that revolving door opens.</i>

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.520
<i>However...</i>

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:13.770
<i>...there are a few obstacles.</i>

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:35.460
<i>The first obstacle is that iron revolving door.</i>

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:42.300
<i>Even though that door opens several times a day, you only get to see through it for a moment.</i>

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:47.680
<i>Next we have a sliding door further down.</i>

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:54.190
<i>The sliding door only opens a few times during the day.</i>

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:07.280
<i>When the revolving door and the sliding door both open at the same time...</i>

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:11.870
<i>...that is when you can see the prison cell.</i>

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.920
<i>However, there is one more obstacle.</i>

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.550
<i>The cell.</i>

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:32.520
<i>A guard and an interviewing attorney are the only people who go through the corridor leading to the cell.</i>

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:37.020
<i>There are no actual windows in the cell walls.</i>

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:41.980
<i>There's only one small aperture on the door that opens to the corridor.</i>

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:46.490
<i>You'll be taking a shot through that aperture.</i>

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:58.790
<i>So to sum up, two doors must open simultaneously and he must approach the aperture.</i>

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:04.630
<i>Those conditions must be met before you take your shot.</i>

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.970
<i>The memories still makes me sick...</i>

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:19.060
<i>When my family was taking a trip on an express train</i>

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:25.610
<i>we got caught up in his indiscriminate act of terror which killed and wounded sixty-four.</i>

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.490
<i>My wife and daughter were among the victims.</i>

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:45.590
<i>That criminal Carronte is a man of violence, a legendary terrorist.</i>

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.520
<i>Carronte was finally apprehended.</i>

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:01.520
<i>But he's being protected by the law inside an airtight cage.</i>

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:09.450
<i>As you can see, I didn't survive with a body that can carry out any type of revenge.</i>

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.780
<i>Do you think some goddamn trial is going to ease my wrath?</i>

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:18.660
<i>I want that bastard burning in hell, right now!</i>

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:53.610
<i>But he's being protected by the law inside an airtight cage.</i>

00:07:54.780 --> 00:08:00.580
<i>As you can see, I didn't survive with a body that can carry out any type of revenge.</i>

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:05.580
<i>Do you think some goddamn trial is going to ease my wrath?</i>

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:10.670
<i>I want that bastard burning in hell, right now!</i>

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:35.870
Hmm?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.470
<i>P... Please!</i>

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.970
<i>Kill...</i>

00:08:56.590 --> 00:09:03.230
<i>Kill Carronte and end my wrath and
my family's wrath while I'm still alive!</i>

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:04.010
How did you find out my true story, and about my top-secret formula?

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.430
Can you make the formula now?

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:22.990
If people find out about this drug,
we'll get another doping controversy.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:28.040
I don't need a speech. Just answer "yes" or "no."

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.300
Can't refuse this offer.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:49.560
Once I get your vital stats, I'll come up with a mixture.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:56.070
If anyone else hears of my stats or this deal, the consequences will be severe.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:12:00.400
You have my word, no one is going to hear about this.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.070
Not when I have this terrific bonus.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:10.080
Still, this moolah will only be enough to pay off my debts.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.330
What did you say?

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.460
You want to maintain the same posture for ten hours?

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.460
That's simply impossible!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:44.720
Humans can only hold the same posture for two or three hours.

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:50.970
Your muscles will get stiff if you hold the same posture for even an hour!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:56.480
I don't care how strong your will or your muscles are, it's just impossible!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.360
I don't need your opinion.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:03.980
What I need is a drug to relax my muscles as much as possible.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.410
Don't you have faith in your own drug?

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:26.510
Well, even if you overdose, it'll only slow down your body for a day.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:29.510
You're not gambling with your life here.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.680
You're good with that, right?

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:37.180
We'll be relaxing your muscles for a full 24 hours.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:40.690
But your fine movements will take a serious turn for the worse.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:50.200
That means your instantaneous reaction and your stamina will decrease by as much as a third!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.870
I made a mixture that's compatible with your body.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.200
Shoot yourself up first.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.830
Quit joking around!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:49.010
I get that you're wary over taking drugs from a
stranger, but you got no choice but to trust me.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.630
There's no point in not taking-

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.600
O-Okay, you got it.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.070
Stop.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.540
So I'm supposed to forget this ever happened, right?

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:28.050
That condition is absolute.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.090
Oh, wait a second!

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:38.350
If you're going to keep your muscles locked for 10 hours, the after-effects will be horrendous.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.560
You'll recover quicker if you get a
professional massage immediately after.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.060
Allow me to do it.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.610
I'll get in touch.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.300
<i>A guard...</i>

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:59.390
<i>...and an interviewing attorney are the only people who go through the corridor.</i>

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:16.780
<i>There is just one small aperture in the cell door.</i>

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:29.460
<i>Not only must the sliding door and the revolving door both be open at the same time...</i>

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:34.670
<i>...Carronte must stand up and come near the aperture as well.</i>

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:05.290
<i>That chance only comes around once every 36,000 seconds.</i>

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.890
Oh, hey.

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.610
Let's get started.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:24.360
So you've held an M16 for ten hours without moving, huh?

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:26.620
Your muscles are stiff as boulders.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:33.290
Well, you did manage to pull the trigger on that M16, right... Golgo 13?

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:45.340
I wanted to get to know you better, so I asked a contact at the FSB.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.390
Man was I surprised.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:21:00.150
Then the guy's superior promised me a handsome reward if I took you down.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.790
I'm also a top-ranked martial artist.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.250
It feels weird fighting you when you're like this....

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:25.090
...but knowing who you are, I can't let that get in the way.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.970
Now don't you move.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:38.100
I don't like using these handguns.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:44.360
Hmph.

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:47.360
That's right, Golgo 13.

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.620
The best always knows when to fold 'em-

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:00.840
So that's how the very best...

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:04.300
...takes every last... precaution?

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:47.260
I  was worried with no one to talk to.

00:22:47.260 --> 00:22:50.300
I was brooding and standing still

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:52.470
without moving a muscle.

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:55.640
I wonder when that was?

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:57.350
I'm sure

00:22:57.350 --> 00:23:00.520
you agonized over how

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:05.780
people will hurt themselves and other people

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:09.030
and fail to realize it.

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:10.160
When

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:13.580
the same days keep repeating themselves

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:15.830
you never change.

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:18.080
Since you're here for me

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:22.380
I will accept the way that I am.

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:26.630
I will never leave you alone

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:29.970
I will softly touch your trembling heart.

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:36.850
I realized that I'm not the only one who's alone.

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:40.020
We're enveloped in the gentle sun beams.

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:43.360
The long winter is finally over.

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:49.990
The parts of us that were lonely will surely get stronger.

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:07.550
Golgo accepted a job from Lee, an Asian movie star that someone wants dead.

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:13.010
The enemy is a large battalion of soldiers who come attacking from every direction.

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:19.020
He will face them alone in a high-rise
building with some tricks up his sleeve.

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:23.560
Next time on Golgo 13: End of the Century Hollywood

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:25.400
End of the Century Hollywood

00:24:24.190 --> 00:24:28.070
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
